      "description": "Flush blocks: brand, run status (OK jade / Failed red), updated.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-bug\"><span class=\"b\">bmiest</span><span class=\"s\">Run OK</span><span class=\"u\">Updated 1 day ago</span></div><div class=\"ds-bug\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><span class=\"b\">bmiest</span><span class=\"s f\">Run failed</span><span class=\"u\">Updated 3 h ago</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-bug{display:flex;height:40px;font-family:Outfit,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-bug>*{display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 16px}.ds-bug .b{background:#0a0b0d;color:#eef1f5;font-size:14px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-bug .s{background:#3fd9a4;color:#0a0b0d;font-size:13px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.ds-bug .s.f{background:#d98b8b;color:#0a0b0d}.ds-bug .u{background:#171a1f;color:#a8b1bc;font-size:13px;font-weight:500}"
    },
    {
